            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_86b9964c">
               <titlePage label="Title page" xml:id="titlePage_931bc282">
                  <p xml:id="idm54">Cantate / i / Anledning af den 28<rend xml:id="idm55" rend="sup">de</rend> Juni 1842 / af / Andersen og Hartmann  / Op 22 / Partitur.</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_5197b1c7">28 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_b01e38b9">27 x 36.5</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_1bfd510d">In brown paper cover. Written in brown ink. Paper: 12 staves. Paginated from first music page. Above the music, on p. 1: "Cantate i Anledning af d: / 28. Junii 1842 IPEHartmann." On p. 18 Hartmann has written: "<rend xml:id="idm59" rend="underline">NB</rend> Det 1<rend xml:id="idm60" rend="sup">ste</rend> og 3<rend xml:id="idm61" rend="sup">die</rend> Vers synges, som de ere skrevne, af 4 Fruentimmerstemmer; men det 2<rend xml:id="idm62" rend="sup">det</rend> og 4<rend xml:id="idm63" rend="sup">de </rend>Vers udskrives for 4 <rend xml:id="idm64" rend="underline">Mands</rend>stemmer, dhr: Faaborg, Sahlgreen, Waltz [corrected in pencil to Gundersen] and Schram. [corrected in pencil to Lund]". At the bottom of the page, he has written: "3<rend xml:id="idm65" rend="sup">die</rend> Vers: Jfr: Hansen, Østerberg, Marcher [corrected in pencil to Liebert], Mad: Faaborg.[corrected in pencil to Fonseca]". At the end of the music on p. 26 end dated: "D: 26. Junii 1842".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
